      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i was moving some heavy boxes earlier today and i felt this really weird ripping sensation in my mid-back. it's kind of spreading down into my stomach too. i'm assuming i just pulled something bad but it hurts a lot. should i just take a bunch of ibuprofen and sleep it off?",
